- **Orchestration**: [start-translation.ps1](file:///c:/ClinicQueueProject/ClinicQueue/ClinicQueue/start-translation.ps1) and configuration in [appsettings.json](file:///c:/ClinicQueueProject/ClinicQueue/ClinicQueue/appsettings.json) are ready.
- **Verification**: Mid-conversation switching and script-fixing (transliteration to Devanagari) verified through the dynamic translation logic.

